## 🗄️ Database Models & Seed Data

### Database Schema
- **`User`**: Profile metadata, designation, department, experience, education, career goal, overall competency score.
- **`Department`**: MoSPI divisions (Data Analytics, National Accounts, Economic Stats, Social Stats, Survey Operations, IT & Digital Services).
- **`Competency`**: 30+ skills mapped to 4 categories with future demand weights.
- **`UserCompetency`**: User baseline and dynamic competency scores, benchmark required scores, proficiency levels.
- **`Course`**: 15+ curated courses (iGOT & NSSTA), skills covered, duration, difficulty, rating, completion rate.
- **`Enrollment`**: User course enrollment status and progress percentage.
- **`QuizAttempt`**: Quiz attempt history, score, percentage, topic breakdown, AI feedback.
- **`LearningMaterial`**: Uploaded document metadata, extracted text, topic summaries.
- **`SkillGap`**: Multi-factor priority score, priority label (Critical/High/Medium/Low), priority rationale.

